{"uid":"6aa455e6ad879f44","name":"test_the_drop_keeps_an_operator_granted_supplementary_group","fullName":"tests.test_engine_uid_boundary#test_the_drop_keeps_an_operator_granted_supplementary_group","historyId":"80a09900323fe9620beebde875f86bab","time":{"start":1791880936242,"stop":1791880936243,"duration":1},"description":"`--allow-docker` adds the host's docker gid with `docker run\n    --group-add`, and that gid has no /etc/group entry inside the image. So\n    `initgroups()` -- which *replaces* the list with what /etc/group says --\n    discards it, and every iteration then gets \"permission denied while trying\n    to connect to the docker API\". For a job whose entire toolchain is sibling\n    containers that means it can build and test nothing, silently, for its whole\n    budget: observed on a real run that burned 45 iterations and failed an\n    approach on the stagnation guard with 0 of 72 tasks done.\n\n    An inherited supplementary group is an explicit operator grant made at\n    `docker run` time. Group 0 is the one that must not survive -- it is the\n    privilege this boundary exists to remove.","descriptionHtml":"<p><code>--allow-docker</code> adds the host's docker gid with <code>docker run --group-add</code>, and that gid has no /etc/group entry inside the image. So<br />\n<code>initgroups()</code> -- which <em>replaces</em> the list with what /etc/group says --<br />\ndiscards it, and every iteration then gets &quot;permission denied while trying<br />\nto connect to the docker API&quot;. For a job whose entire toolchain is sibling<br />\ncontainers that means it can build and test nothing, silently, for its whole<br />\nbudget: observed on a real run that burned 45 iterations and failed an<br />\napproach on the stagnation guard with 0 of 72 tasks done.</p>\n<pre><code>An inherited supplementary group is an explicit operator grant made at\n`docker run` time. Group 0 is the one that must not survive -- it is the\nprivilege this boundary exists to remove.\n</code></pre>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"event_loop_policy","time":{"start":1791880795037,"stop":1791880795037,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"tmp_path_factory","time":{"start":1791880795038,"stop":1791880795038,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_isolate_ambient_home_in_process","time":{"start":1791880936231,"stop":1791880936235,"duration":4},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"monkeypatch","time":{"start":1791880936231,"stop":1791880936231,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_isolate_ambient_task_record_dir","time":{"start":1791880936236,"stop":1791880936236,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_scrub_notifier_env_in_process","time":{"start":1791880936236,"stop":1791880936240,"duration":4},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_stub_escalation_backoff_at_class_level","time":{"start":1791880936241,"stop":1791880936241,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"steps